Items you must complete yourself
Some parts need your own accounts and real use over time, so they can't be completed by a document alone:
Notion workspace (Task 5): create it in your Notion account using the guide in 02.
Obsidian vault (Task 6): install Obsidian (free) and open 04_Obsidian_Vault as a vault.
2-week trial (Task 7): use the system for 14 days and fill in 05_Trial_Log.md with real numbers.
Automation (Task 9): set up the steps in 08 in Zapier/Make (free tier) or Notion.
Final demo: practice using 13.
Fill the bracketed [ ] placeholders with your real results. Do not submit invented numbers.
